  "notes": "No mosque or building drawn, and nothing of its destruction (Al-Muyassar's «وقد هُدِم… وأُحرِق» is not used); Abu 'Amir is not named. Their oath (107:16-20) is not glossed; 107:21-24 «فيما يحلفون عليه». Wind for «وتفريقا بين المؤمنين», light for «أسس على التقوى», rain for «يتطهروا», geometric for «تقوى من الله», a mountain for «شفا جرف هار» that leaves before the Fire. STAGING v4: No mosque or prayer hall is drawn anywhere in this video. c1 (107): a town by day (As-Sa'di: hypocrites of the people of Quba). Three men (the hypocrites) on the right, three believers on the left. A brick-wall plate on 107:3-4 (they built it: Al-Muyassar); the building itself is never drawn and nothing of its destruction is drawn or suggested (the plate dissolves, it does not undraw). A wind plate on 107:6-8 (dividing the believers); the camera holds on the hypocrites for 107:9 (the station prepared for the one who fought); the one who fought is not drawn or named; the shot is wide while the Name and the Messenger are recited (107:11-13). They swear on 107:16 (Al-Muyassar: kindness to the Muslims and room for the weak); the speech arcs point at the believers who are present; a geometric plate from 107:22 (Allah testifies; it starts on the verb, not on the Name) and the camera on them for 107:23-24. c2 (108): the town again, by day. 108:1-15 is addressed to the Messenger (do not stand in it; the mosque founded on piety is worthier for you to stand in): the background is quiet there and only wide shots are used; nobody stands or prays where he is addressed. Three believers walk in on 108:5 (the mosque founded on piety: Quba, both tafsirs); a light plate on 108:8-11 (piety); the camera closes on them on 108:16 (in it are men); a water-drop plate on 108:18-20 (they love to purify themselves: Al-Muyassar, with water) that leaves before the Name; a soft sparkle on them on 108:22 (Allah loves those who purify themselves); nobody prays. c3 (109) stays ambient: the parable ends in the collapse into the Fire; a geometric plate on 109:2-8 (piety from Allah) and a mountain plate on 109:15-17 (the edge of a crumbling bank: no wind, nothing that suggests a cause of the collapse; it leaves before the Fire). Cover: the geometric plate on piety from Allah (109:5), no people and no building."
